{"chunk_id": "d025827e5653", "text": "As Ravana carries the abducted Sita through the sky, the aged vulture-king Jatayu confronts him in a fierce aerial battle. The two clash like storm clouds and winged mountains. Ravana showers the bird with arrows, but Jatayu endures and retaliates with talons and wings, breaking Ravana\u2019s bow, smashing his shield, and even destroying his enchanted chariot and its demon-headed mules. For a moment the world rejoices as Ravana is forced to the ground. Yet the titan, noticing Jatayu\u2019s age and exhaustion, rises again into the air with Sita. Jatayu blocks him and delivers a prophetic rebuke, warning that abducting Rama\u2019s wife will bring Ravana\u2019s destruction. The episode dramatizes heroic sacrifice and foreshadows the downfall of Lanka\u2019s king.\nJatayu fiercely battles Ravana in the sky to rescue Sita, destroying his chariot and weapons while warning him of Rama\u2019s inevitable vengeance.\nThemes: heroic sacrifice, dharma vs adharma, loyalty to Rama, warning of fate, battle in the sky", "vector": [-0.01572095789015293, -0.029592391103506088, -0.0031076702289283276, 0.016739536076784134, -0.013315236195921898, 0.009790417738258839, -0.03431002050638199, -0.022596364840865135, -0.01960764080286026, -0.03283575922250748, 0.01300028059631586, 0.017007583752274513, 0.015412704087793827, 0.007002728525549173, 0.008141928352415562, -0.0034259760286659002, 0.03079860284924507, -0.011311584152281284, 0.022328317165374756, -0.025022190064191818, -0.008845551870763302, -0.006124874576926231, -0.011338389478623867, 0.010152281261980534, -0.02250254712998867, 0.006744733080267906, 0.02833257056772709, -0.03632037341594696, 0.031093453988432884, -0.004298804327845573, -0.010829099453985691, -0.007766662631183863, -0.014608562923967838, -0.008523895405232906, -0.01987568661570549, -0.0033154066186398268, 0.0033388608135282993, -0.01968805491924286, 0.013737410306930542, 0.009890935383737087, 0.008731631562113762, 0.0028664278